  "about": {
    "title": "About the Chaos Rising set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Chaos Rising is a Mega Evolution expansion released on 22 May 2026. It has 122 cards: 86 in the main set and 36 secret rares. For a master set there are also 76 reverse holos, and 4 special prints from other products and events.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 86 main set cards), the <b>Complete set</b> (all 122 cards), the <b>Master set</b> (198 cards, adding every reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (202 cards, adding the 4 special prints (stamped, Cosmos Holo and other product-exclusive cards)).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
